  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "336dno",
      "content": "**The genius Mary sue goes cruel but not evil**\r\n\r\nElizabeth is artificially portrayed as an omnipotent genius, also with political power yet fail to provide the plebs with education then blame them for being ignorant.\r\n\r\nThis world has magic yet somehow everyone around is a moron and cant check magic influence or have her controlled because she is the only person keeping this kingdom going. She goes for pure person to cruel (cruel no evil) very fast, all that journey could have been 1-2 season here is one episode.\r\n\r\nShe is cruel not evil, also extremely bad at it, Roberto Arti such a expensive pawn, it damaged her hand, is wasted on few kids and poor people instead of poisoning the water supply and damaging the whole capital or doing something even more evil. Also Roberto Arti get executed very has ending his suffering when could be been alive in prison going mad about what he was forced to do...... very bad writing and very bad plot",
      "rating": 5,
      "createdAt": "2026-08-24T23:38:56Z"
    }
  ],
